# Afrikaans (af_ZA) draft for School Connect's app-only strings.
# Vocabulary (South African school terms): registerklas (form group; Gibbon has both Vormgroep
# and rolgroep), graad (year group, as in Graad 7; Gibbon has Jaargroep), klas (class, a teaching
# group), vak (course; Gibbon has Kursus), les / periode (lesson / period), skooljaar,
# kwartaal (term; Gibbon's Termyn/bepalings mean a period of time / terms and conditions),
# huiswerk, rooster (timetable), beplanner (planner), puntestaat (markbook), punte (grades),
# personeel (staff), leerder (student), ouer (parent), volwassene, lokaal (facility),
# leerarea (learning area), departement, inskrywing (enrolment), bywoning (attendance),
# registeronderwyser (tutor), rapport (report card), gedrag (behaviour).
# Addresses the reader as jy, as Gibbon's Afrikaans does. Buttons in the imperative.

